  "aliases": ["p-funk", "70s funk", "soul funk", "james brown", "groove"],
  "description": "Funk: 96 to 116 BPM and everything on the one: a syncopated kick, a snare on two and four with ghost notes between, sixteenth hats, a finger or slap bass playing off the beat, clavinet and a rhythm guitar chopping sixteenths, horn stabs answering, an organ under it, long vamps on one chord",
  "query": "funk music",
  "alts": ["jazz music", "hip hop beat with heavy bass", "rock music with electric guitars", "house music"],
  "bpm": [96, 116],
  "swing": [0.52, 0.6],
